  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "Angles \\(\\angle A\\) and \\(\\angle D\\) are same-side interior angles formed when lines \\(AB\\) and \\(DC\\) are cut by \\(AD\\). They are supplementary, so \\(AB\\parallel CD\\). We cannot conclude that \\(AD\\parallel BC\\).",
